{"page":20246,"part":1,"text":"《禁经》云：八法起于隶字之始，自崔、张、钟、王传授所用，该于万字墨道之最，不可不明也。隋僧智永发其指趋。授于虞秘监世南，自兹传授彰厥存焉。李阳水云：昔逸少上书，遂历多载，十五年中，偏攻永字，以其八法之势能通一切也。八法者，永字八画是矣。\n\n一、点为侧  （如鸟之翻然侧下）\n\n二、横为勒  （如勒马之用缰）\n\n三、竖为弩  （用力也）\n\n四、挑为趯  （跳貌，与跃同）\n\n五、左上为策  （如策马之用鞭）\n\n六、左下为略  （如用篦之掠发）\n\n七、右上为啄  （如鸟之啄物）\n\n八、右下为磔（磔音窄，裂牲为磔，笔锋开张也）\n\n【诀一】侧蹲鸱而坠石，勒纵缓以藏机。弩弯环而势曲，峻快以如锥。策依稀而似勒，略彷佛以宜肥。啄腾凌而速进，磔忆昔以迟移。\n\n诀云：侧不愧卧，勒常患平。弩过直而力败，趁宜存而势生。策仰收而暗揭，略左出而锋轻。啄仓皇而疾掩，磔<走历>趞以开撑。","eligible":true,"blockedReasons":[],"source":{"kind":"human-txt","page":20246,"part":1,"label":"wolai标准正文／原人工审核独有补充","verifiedBy":"项目负责人（本对话确认）","verifiedAt":"2026-10-22T07:57:06+00:00","revision":"e87e59b253ad169ae6a4b29de75ecc42abdc9e4140d7662ab0ba0b7c6848de6c","textSha256":"e87e59b253ad169ae6a4b29de75ecc42abdc9e4140d7662ab0ba0b7c6848de6c","fileSha256":"e87e59b253ad169ae6a4b29de75ecc42abdc9e4140d7662ab0ba0b7c6848de6c","txtPath":"annotation-data/wolai-txt/20246-wolai-5122gXdcRhagcwQXCfzxuy.txt","reviewCsvPath":"annotation-data/wolai-review.csv","standardCorpus":"wolai-standard","displayLabel":"永字八法 · 永字八法","sourceUrl":"https://www.wolai.com/mojiyi/5122gXdcRhagcwQXCfzxuy","originalPages":[],"positionStatus":"原图只作篇目参考；新版正文不声称与旧扫描逐字对齐","provenance":[{"start":0,"end":118,"sourceTextSha256":"8600cbb76551279707ff966ed7242c1e2306f5fa748844c02b32871985af0750","id":"mHQzhAr6eixGS7YEHaaErY","page_id":"5122gXdcRhagcwQXCfzxuy","root_id":"5122gXdcRhagcwQXCfzxuy","work":"永字八法","author":"佚名三篇","type":"text","origin":"wolai-block","rawStart":0,"rawEnd":118},{"start":120,"end":136,"sourceTextSha256":"761102239395cfa56793d3d16e635d39383d61922390e35ff25a109491f7fa1b","id":"agnq8xcVSV8sBMjSPDiGag","page_id":"5122gXdcRhagcwQXCfzxuy","root_id":"5122gXdcRhagcwQXCfzxuy","work":"永字八法","author":"佚名三篇","type":"text","origin":"wolai-block","rawStart":0,"rawEnd":16},{"start":138,"end":153,"sourceTextSha256":"1f5d35ecb0e40aa6197daf6aebba165275c9d5eed624e588c9afd51c59555d04","id":"4SLsJxvctBTurg59tbEpuc","page_id":"5122gXdcRhagcwQXCfzxuy","root_id":"5122gXdcRhagcwQXCfz